    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "N1U9PB",
      "x": 568,
      "y": -1935,
      "name": "Behavior Note / Type-Anywhere Search",
      "width": 440,
      "height": 150,
      "content": "TYPE-ANYWHERE SEARCH\n\nIdle — translucent surface with backdrop blur; no placeholder text and no shortcut affordance.\n\nActivate — hovering the search area OR typing anywhere in the Quiver window restores the solid surface and reveals the live query/caret. Input begins immediately; there is no ⌘K interaction."
    }
